# Portfolio repo — example environment variables
# Copy to `.env` only if you add tooling that needs env vars.
#
# Note: preferred template name is `.env.example` (user may also say `.env_example`).
# The live app lives under `frontend/`; see `frontend/.env.example` for Vite vars.
#
# This portfolio is a static React site — no backend secrets are required by default.

# Optional: future deploy / CI placeholders (names only)
# DEPLOY_HOST=
# DEPLOY_USER=
